:차이석 rdf:type :Person .
:이용익 rdf:type :Person .
:이종호 rdf:type :Person .
:손병희 rdf:type :Person .
:이회영 rdf:type :Person .
:이시영 rdf:type :Person .
:이동녕 rdf:type :Person .
:이상룡 rdf:type :Person .
:지청천 rdf:type :Person .
:이종일 rdf:type :Person .
:한용운 rdf:type :Person .
:오세창 rdf:type :Person .
:김좌진 rdf:type :Person .
:서일 rdf:type :Person .
