:이승만 rdf:type :Person .
:이동휘 rdf:type :Person .
:최린 rdf:type :Person .
:정춘수 rdf:type :Person .
:박희도 rdf:type :Person .
:오산학교 rdf:type :Group .
:대성학교 rdf:type :Group .
:숭실학교 rdf:type :Group .
:보성학교 rdf:type :Group .
:신흥무관학교 rdf:type :Group .
:신민회 rdf:type :Group .
